      <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5h16v14H4z"/><path d="M8 9h8M8 13h5"/></svg></div><div><b>Source-checked, not opinion</b><span>Every clinical statement traces to the US Standard of Care, the 2024 German guideline, the Lipedema Foundation, and peer-reviewed research through September 2026, with an evidence tag on every treatment claim.</span></div></div>
      <div class="row"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v18M5 8l7-5 7 5M5 16l7 5 7-5"/></svg></div><div><b>Action steps in every chapter</b><span>Compression pressures and knits decoded, a six-station self-drainage routine with a diagram, a weekly movement plan, an eating framework built on the only randomized trial, a flare protocol, a 30-day plan.</span></div></div>
